Bundled third-party code
-------------------------

lib/ocean-renderer.js is derived from the ocean renderer in
dsh-ascii-ocean (https://github.com/GqqQq-Q/dsh-ascii-ocean), distributed
under the MIT License, which itself ports the ascii-sharks demo by
stackedlol (https://github.com/stackedlol/ascii-sharks).

That upstream work remains under its own MIT license and copyright; the
modifications made in this repository are limited to the ones documented in
README.md ("How it works" / "实现") and are released under the same MIT terms.
